title: "How Large Language Models Work: From Math to Transformers"
abstract: "A free video course that builds large language models up from the math: vectors, probability, calculus, neural networks, attention and the transformer, with a runnable companion notebook and a sourced research brief for every episode. One running sentence, \"The cat sat on the mat because it was tired.\", carries through the whole series."
